    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11699" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειλέω</span></b>  (A), Elean <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποϝηλέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keep away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῶ βωμῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					1159
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1150
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ μαντείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1154
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ἀπορίην
			ἀπειληθείς</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειλημένος</span>
			<i>brought</i> into great straits, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.141
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ἀναγκαίην ἀπειλημένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.109
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειληθέντες ἐς στεινόν</span>
			<i>forced</i> into narrow compass, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				9.34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unroll, roll off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				5.5
			</span></i>.</div>
